# Maintained command palette for Meta+k.
# Format: shortcut|description|command
# Notes:
# - Keep this file updated when adding/removing shortcuts in sway/config or Waybar actions.
# - `command` is optional; if empty, the palette only documents the shortcut.

Meta+k|Open this command palette|~/.config/scripts/commands_palette.sh
Meta+Shift+p|Open custom tools fuzzy menu|~/.config/scripts/tools_menu.sh
Alt+Tab|Cycle through open windows, release Alt to confirm|~/.config/scripts/window_switcher.sh --cycle-next
Alt+Shift+Tab|Cycle backward through open windows, release Alt to confirm|~/.config/scripts/window_switcher.sh --cycle-prev
Meta+Return|Open a Kitty terminal|kitty
Meta+Shift+Return|Open LibreWolf (default browser)|~/.config/scripts/browser_launch.sh
Meta+space|Open the app launcher (fuzzel preferred)|~/.config/scripts/app_launcher.sh
Meta+Shift+space|Launch Handy|~/.config/scripts/handy_launch.sh
Meta+Shift+o|Launch Obsidian|~/.config/scripts/obsidian_launch.sh
Meta+Ctrl+s|Launch LocalSend|~/.config/scripts/localsend_launch.sh
Meta+Shift+e|Launch email client (Thunderbird)|~/.config/scripts/mail_launcher.sh
Meta+e|Open a file manager|sh -lc 'if command -v nautilus >/dev/null 2>&1; then exec nautilus; fi; if command -v dolphin >/dev/null 2>&1; then exec dolphin; fi; if command -v thunar >/dev/null 2>&1; then exec thunar; fi; if command -v nemo >/dev/null 2>&1; then exec nemo; fi; if command -v pcmanfm >/dev/null 2>&1; then exec pcmanfm; fi; notify-send "File Manager" "No supported file manager found (nautilus/dolphin/thunar/nemo/pcmanfm)"'
Meta+q|Close the focused window|swaymsg kill
Meta+w|Close the focused window|swaymsg kill
Meta+Escape|Close all windows|~/.config/scripts/close_all_windows.sh
Meta+f|Toggle fullscreen for focused window|swaymsg fullscreen toggle
Meta+v|Split pane beside (vertical)|swaymsg splitv
Meta+h|Split pane below (horizontal)|swaymsg splith
Meta+Shift+v|Set current container layout to vertical split|swaymsg layout splitv
Meta+Shift+h|Set current container layout to horizontal split|swaymsg layout splith
Meta+t|Toggle floating mode for focused window|swaymsg floating toggle
Meta+LeftClick (floating)|Move floating window with mouse|
Meta+RightClick (floating)|Resize floating window with mouse|

Meta+Left|Focus the window on the left|swaymsg focus left
Meta+Right|Focus the window on the right|swaymsg focus right
Meta+Up|Focus the window above|swaymsg focus up
Meta+Down|Focus the window below|swaymsg focus down

Meta+Shift+Left|Move focused window to the left|swaymsg move left
Meta+Shift+Right|Move focused window to the right|swaymsg move right
Meta+Shift+Up|Move focused window upward|swaymsg move up
Meta+Shift+Down|Move focused window downward|swaymsg move down

Meta+Tab|Switch to next workspace|swaymsg workspace next
Meta+Shift+Tab|Switch to previous workspace|swaymsg workspace prev
Meta+Ctrl+Right|Switch to next workspace|swaymsg workspace next
Meta+Ctrl+Left|Switch to previous workspace|swaymsg workspace prev

Meta+[&,é,",',(,-,è,_,ç]|Switch to workspace 1..9 on AZERTY top row|
Meta+Shift+[&,é,",',(,-,è,_,ç]|Send focused window to workspace 1..9 and follow it on AZERTY top row|
Meta+KP_[1..9]|Switch to workspace using numpad|
Meta+Shift+KP_[1..9]|Send focused window to numpad workspace and follow it|

Meta+Shift+r|Reload Sway and restart Waybar|~/.config/scripts/reload_env.sh
Meta+Shift+x|Exit Sway session|swaymsg exit
Meta+l|Lock current session|swaylock -f -c 000000
Ctrl+Alt+Delete|Open power screen|~/.config/scripts/power_screen.sh
Meta+Ctrl+c|Open capture menu|~/.config/scripts/capture_menu.sh
Print|Take a screenshot|~/.config/scripts/screenshot_capture.sh
Meta+Print|Take a screenshot of the active window|~/.config/scripts/screenshot_active_window.sh
Meta+Shift+Print|Open color picker|~/.config/scripts/color_picker.sh
Meta+Shift+w|Open wallpaper fuzzy picker|~/.config/scripts/wallpaper_picker.sh

XF86AudioRaiseVolume|Increase output volume by 5%|wpctl set-volume @DEFAULT_AUDIO_SINK@ 5%+
XF86AudioLowerVolume|Decrease output volume by 5%|wpctl set-volume @DEFAULT_AUDIO_SINK@ 5%-
XF86AudioMute|Toggle output mute|wpctl set-mute @DEFAULT_AUDIO_SINK@ toggle
